{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月24日，據《商業內幕》報道，在被恢復CEO職務後，黃仁勳(Jensen Huang)周一重返英偉達位於聖克拉拉的公司總部，受到員工的熱烈歡迎，此時距離他令人震驚地被免職還不到兩周。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587774.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:23:52.382771+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:58:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T03:17:13.071699+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T03:17:13.071699+00:00","content_hash":"fdeae180f09f224c7b4a855f77dfe5b4e412f7569ba7cce0fc1be4740903f72a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}